Colossal Cave Adventure -- the mungo-caverns mill

This directory is a Shoddy forward-port of Open Adventure by Eric S.
Raymond (https://gitlab.com/esr/open-adventure), which is itself a
forward-port of Adventure 2.5 (1995) by Will Crowther and Don Woods --
the last version of Colossal Cave Adventure in the main line of
development by the game's original authors. Adventure was originally
written by Will Crowther; most of the features of the game as it stands
were added by Don Woods. Open Adventure was released under the BSD
2-Clause License with the original authors' permission and
encouragement.

Because it is a derivative of that work, this directory is licensed
under the BSD 2-Clause License below -- not the MIT License that covers
the rest of the Shoddy repository.

